OL,3,GNEWSAFirm launches appeal after gas rig
OL,4,Aplan refused
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe firm behind plans to build a gas
OL,7,Fdrilling rig in a North Yorkshire
OL,8,Fvillage has launched an appeal after
OL,9,Fthe scheme was refused by councillors.
OL,11,FEuropa Oil & Gas wants to build a
OL,12,Ftemporary 125ft (38m) rig in Burniston
OL,13,Fto explore the potential to extract
OL,14,Fgas.
OL,16,FThe rig would use the "proppant
OL,17,Fsqueeze" method, which has been likened
OL,18,Fto "small-scale fracking" but is
OL,19,Fallowed under current legislation.
OL,23,APub: 03-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
