OL,3,GNEWSAFirm launches appeal after gas rig
OL,4,Aplan refused
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe appeal has been lodged following
OL,7,FNorth Yorkshire Council's formal
OL,8,Frejection of the plans in May, and will
OL,9,Fnow be determined by the Planning
OL,10,FInspectorate.
